('node-1-25', 'phase-01-lesson-25-building-a-clean-cli-application', 'module-2', 25, 'Lesson 2.25: Building a Clean CLI Application', 'Prerequisites: Lesson 1.8, Lesson 1.21', 'Prerequisites: Lesson 1.8, Lesson 1.21 | Subtopics: 4 items', 'Systems project application', 120, 2, 310.0, 1250.0, '# Lesson 1.25: Building a Clean CLI Application

